{"corpus":"ccc","number":652,"text_html":"<span>La Résurrection du Christ est <i class=\"typo_italic\">accomplissement des promesses</i> de l’Ancien Testament <sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"1\">1</sup> et de Jésus<sup class=\"srcRef cccRef\">§994</sup> lui-même durant sa vie terrestre <sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"3\">3</sup>. L’expression « selon les Écritures » <sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"6\">6</sup> indique que la Résurrection du Christ<sup class=\"srcRef cccRef\">§601</sup> accomplit ces prédictions.</span>","cross_refs":["994","601"],"bible_refs":[{"text":"Lc 24:26-27"},{"text":"Lc 24:44-48"},{"text":"Mt 28:6"},{"text":"Mc 16:7"},{"text":"Lc 24:6-7"},{"text":"1 Co 15:3-4"}],"citations":[],"magisterial_refs":[{"type":"bible","raw":"voir Lc 24:26-27","idx":1},{"type":"bible_continuation","raw":"24:44-48","idx":2,"marker_idx":1},{"type":"bible","raw":"voir Mt 28:6","idx":3},{"type":"bible","raw":"Mc 16:7","idx":4,"marker_idx":3},{"type":"bible","raw":"Lc 24:6-7","idx":5,"marker_idx":3},{"type":"bible","raw":"voir 1 Co 15:3-4 et le Symbole de Nicée-Constantinople","idx":6}]}